# LightCraft (catalogo e sviluppo RAW). Read by creative-run (creative-app@.service), the MCP bridge (mcp-server/server.py)
# and the session generator (deploy/gen-session-config.py): one file per app, no duplicated settings.
LABEL=LightCraft
CATEGORY="Grafica"
CONTROL_PORT=7985
OPEN_METHOD=app.open
CLI_ACTIONS="run render export commands controls"
APP_ARGS="--library /workspace/LightCraft-Library"
AUTOSTART=no
# The display is software-rendered (Mesa llvmpipe); one thread keeps an idle window cheap.
LP_NUM_THREADS=1
